<p>		     1.8785/90  German Marks</p>
<p>		     2.1154/64  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.5332/42  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     38.78/79   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     6.3405/25  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1838.1/8.6 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     119.30/40  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     8.0613/63  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.7429/26  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.1580/28  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6237/42</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$317.95/45</p>
